e fearless coming out of  GSB and are going to push this a little  bit further and when you do that free  cash flows are not going to be free  anymore it will require you to challenge  yourselves and redefine what you mean by  success pretty regularly really and when  you do I'm hoping that when you go out  from GSB you will come back and you know  give us inputs and feedback like you  have while you were here so that you  challenge us because that's the only way  we build a knowledge stock on which the  next generations can really build on and  you know I like to call it standing on  the shoulder of giants which is all of  you and us where next generations can  stand and look far but I was at a  Midwest GST where I was told no no no  that is old school the new  you're standing on the shoulder of  dinosaurs because then you can see even  further so whatever you guys need to go  out and then come back and and let us  know what are we doing right and what  are we not doing wrong but the bottom  line is that the problems are complex  and the solutions are unknown but my  hope is that all of you who have taken  my classes and we have learned together  are gonna use some of this and as you  are going to be figuring out the answers  which will help us to together change  lives change organizations and change  the world to make it a better place than  what you and I got when we sort of  started so with that again thank you  everyone really appreciate it and this  is going to be a very memorable day for  many years to come for me thank you very  much  [Applause]  [Music]

